; DNS records to apply when the domain is bought (docs/adr/0026-step-up-and-transport.md).
; Nothing in this repository applies them. Replace the domain if a different one is bought.
; DNSSEC (ECDSAP256SHA256, algorithm 13) is switched on at the registrar, not in this file.
$ORIGIN graphinity.com.
$TTL 3600

; Only these two authorities may issue certificates; wildcards from nobody.
@       CAA  0 issue "letsencrypt.org"
@       CAA  0 issue "pki.goog"
@       CAA  0 issuewild ";"
@       CAA  0 iodef "mailto:security@graphinity.com"

; Graphinity sends no email from this domain: anything claiming to is forged.
@       TXT  "v=spf1 -all"
_dmarc  TXT  "v=DMARC1; p=reject; sp=reject; adkim=s; aspf=s; fo=1; rua=mailto:dmarc@graphinity.com"
